# reference material, not source
#
# Both are bundles we measure our own work against rather than build from: a
# shipped 300x600 banner from another agency, and the UI/UX design archive.
# They are large, binary and never imported by the application, so they live on
# disk and stay out of the history. `docs/PLATFORM.md` points at the banner by
# name; the check that every documented path exists treats an absent reference
# bundle as fine.
reference-banners/
Kapsamlı UIUX Tasarımı.zip
